#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2011 expect=noViolation domain=AE
#note "Every populated AEHLTCD is a High Level Term code of the (dummy) MedDRA dictionary; the missing AEHLTCD on row 3 does not fire. AEHLTCD is Num per SDTMIG 3.4."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset AE
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEHLT   type=Char
col AEHLTCD type=Num
---
001 | Headaches NEC                | 10019231
001 | Nausea and vomiting symptoms | 10028817
002 | Headaches NEC                | .
